abstract: >-
  Verified assistant for Vietnamese administrative procedures: hybrid retrieval over 107
  procedures from the Ministry of Public Security's public service portal, a tool-less local
  LLM composer, a numeric/citation verifier with deterministic template fallback, and an open
  evaluation suite. Built for Data for Life 2026, challenge DA940-01.
